## Open Questions

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Wave system design**: Two options:
> 1. **Manual waves** — You define wave groups in the editor (e.g., "Wave 1 = targets A,B,C; Wave 2 = D,E,F")
> 2. **Auto-waves by row** — ShooterController picks N random targets from each row per wave, configurable counts
>
> Which do you prefer? Plan below assumes **option 2** (auto-waves) since it's more flexible with editor-placed targets.

> [!IMPORTANT]
> **Game-end condition**: Currently timer-only (90s). Do you also want a "all waves completed" end condition, or purely timer-based?

